  "goodToKnow": "Der Spitzenpolitiker or die Spitzenpolitikerin is a leading politician. The prefix Spitzen- means top: Spitzenkandidat (lead candidate), Spitzensportler, Spitzenreiter (leader), Spitzenqualität. Die Spitze is a peak, top or tip; Spitze! means great. The opposite is der Hinterbänkler (backbencher). The plural is the same."
